ClashNl for Android
===================

ClashNl is based on the Android client architecture from
SagerNet/sing-box-for-android and uses the Mihomo core sources provided by the
MetaCubeX/ClashMetaForAndroid submodule at commit
c454d0e73b047d9f4c0173e8d35088f08b65bc98.

Upstream sources:
  https://github.com/SagerNet/sing-box-for-android
  https://github.com/MetaCubeX/ClashMetaForAndroid
  https://github.com/MetaCubeX/mihomo
  https://github.com/termux/termux-app

The Android client, Mihomo core, and Termux terminal components are distributed
under GNU General Public License version 3 or later. The project license is in
LICENSE, and the Termux component license is in
third_party/termux-app/LICENSE.md.

ClashNl changes include independent branding and package ID, a single native
Mihomo runtime, Clash/Clash Meta import links, Android privacy disclosure, and
shared protocol examples.

The Android package includes the 2026-08-22 country-lite.mmdb snapshot from
MetaCubeX/meta-rules-dat under GPL-3.0. It allows Mihomo profiles using GeoIP
DNS filtering to start without an initial network download. Source and license:
  https://github.com/MetaCubeX/meta-rules-dat
SHA-256:
  248b91c2c9cf46c9ae75b27ab8bee7b44d3f745b6a1372da75b2120494284f7b

ClashNl is an independent project and does not imply association with SagerNet,
